1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:09,320
Bologna.

2
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:09,320
Milano.

3
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:15,360
Sgarbiman!

4
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:19,680
Don Giussani, cosa vi dice la Madonnina?

5
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:22,560
Siate moderati, siate buoni cristiani.

6
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:22,560
Firenze.

7
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:25,840
Sgarbiman!

8
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:34,800
Giotto. Giotto si nasce, moderati si

9
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:37,840
diventa. Salvate la bellezza. Roma.

10
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:40,120
Garbiman, sono qui! Smettila, avrà

11
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:41,760
missioni più importanti da compiere.

12
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:46,520
Francesco!

13
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:48,880
Siate moderati, cercate la pace.

14
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:51,040
Napoli.

15
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:52,120
Sgarbiman!

16
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:54,280
Guagliò!

17
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:58,200
Che dice San Gennaro?

18
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:59,720
Siate moderati, fate l'amore, non fate

19
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,000
