20
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:03,160
Palermo.

21
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,880
Ehi, guarda!

22
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:09,040
Sgarbiman, mio eroe! Sgarbaman, aiutaci

23
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:12,520
tu!

24
00:01:09,040 --> 00:01:16,160
Chiederò in alto. Vergine santa!

25
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:19,560
Siate moderati e risoluti come me.

26
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:19,560
Non fate le capre.

